OL,3,ATwo teenagers, 13 and 14, among 33 UK
OL,4,Anationals missing in Nepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham said the UK has offered
OL,7,F#5m to help the Nepalese government
OL,8,Ffollowing the floods, saying it was a
OL,9,F"very distressing and devastating
OL,10,Fsituation".
